@SmartParking.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295

### 1. Health Check
GET {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. System Info
GET {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

### 3. System Health Controller
GET {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/health
Accept: application/json

### 4. Swagger OpenAPI Spec
GET {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

### Confirm a pending booking at the actual parked slot (replace token, booking ID, slot ID, and image URL)
POST {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/parking-sessions/bookings/1/confirm-parked
Authorization: ******
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "51F-123.45",
  "slotId": 101,
  "checkInImageUrl": "https://example.com/verified-plate.jpg"
}

### Upload an image (replace the bearer token and local file path)
POST {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ImageBoundary

--ImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="parking.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:\path\to\parking.png
--ImageBoundary--

### Get image metadata (replace the ID)
GET {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/images/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Delete an image (replace the ID)
DELETE {{SmartParking.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/images/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
